5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our chosen project truly flourishes, we must look beyond the theory and verify that the practical means to execute the work are firmly in place.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. It is so important that the researchers have the actual resources they need to succeed. I want to make sure the funding is sufficient for the current costs of running a lab.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you! We should check if the shared facilities can actually handle more work. If the equipment is already overloaded, even a great project might get stuck. Let's see what's really happening on the ground!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a brilliant blueprint is useless if the construction site is a swamp. I am particularly interested in where projects typically stall due to non-scientific interruptions. We should examine the historical record of delays.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Instinct can be misleading. We should prioritize evidence of actual delivery over theoretical promise to ensure this grant produces tangible results.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom teaches us that while funds are fleeting, the mastery of a skilled hand is a rare treasure. We must ascertain who is truly available to guide these projects to fruition.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That is a very good point, Servas. I also wonder about the hidden costs. I want to see if the agency still covers certain overheads or if those burdens have shifted to the researchers themselves.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That's a great point! I also want to know if the people running the machines are overwhelmed. If the staff are too busy, the best equipment in the world won't help us. Let's dig in!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite right. To avoid the tragedy of a project frozen in bureaucracy or logistical limbo, I believe we should scrutinize the patterns of past failures and the actual availability of essential support.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Consistency is key. I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns to see which types of projects actually deliver on their promises.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Let us be mindful that the heart of any endeavor is its people. I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to ensure the expertise exists.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think it would be helpful to look at the national computing agreement and facility day rates, as well as the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, to understand the current cost landscape.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation! I want to see if the machines are actually working and if there's any room left for us.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"To complement our findings, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites. Let us see where the ghosts of delays typically reside.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will stick with my plan. I shall look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns to determine which project models have a proven track record of success.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By looking into both the physical tools and the human spirit that drives them, we shall find the path that leads to the most enduring success.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we've reached an agreement. I look forward to seeing what we discover so we can support the researchers in the most helpful way possible. I'll start my research now.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
