23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm really excited to see what's going on with the equipment. I'll go check those logs and bookings right now. Let's find the best project together!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent arrangement. I shall venture into the archives to see which logistical hurdles have historically tripped up our colleagues. I look forward to our subsequent revelations.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
