27,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The plan is sound. I will now examine the records to see which project structures have historically delivered results and which have merely promised them. I look forward to the findings.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
